If P42 indicates an element is only a 2D reference, maintain that distinction in the VR review.

## P43 — Terrain & Topographic Site Modeling

Show the supported P43 terrain surface and related data only where the current project has valid terrain information.

Preserve the distinction between raw and calibrated elevations, horizontal CRS, vertical datum, units, and source confidence wherever those fields exist.

